$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tonatlt  LOC_AFTER=?

* The value of a bit word is below 2 to its length (Lean: toNat_lt_two_pow).

s1::id |- ( L e. Word 2o -> L e. Word 2o )
i2::tonatcl
s3:s1,i2:syl |- ( L e. Word 2o -> ( toNat ` L ) e. NN0 )
s4:s3:nn0zd |- ( L e. Word 2o -> ( toNat ` L ) e. ZZ )
i5::lencl
s6:s1,i5:syl |- ( L e. Word 2o -> ( # ` L ) e. NN0 )
i7::bitsfzo
s8:s4,s6,i7:syl2anc |- ( L e. Word 2o -> ( ( toNat ` L ) e. ( 0 ..^ ( 2 ^ ( # ` L ) ) ) <-> ( bits ` ( toNat ` L ) ) C_ ( 0 ..^ ( # ` L ) ) ) )
s9::bwbitsss |- ( L e. Word 2o -> ( bits ` ( toNat ` L ) ) C_ ( 0 ..^ ( # ` L ) ) )
s10:s9,s8:mpbird |- ( L e. Word 2o -> ( toNat ` L ) e. ( 0 ..^ ( 2 ^ ( # ` L ) ) ) )
i11::elfzolt2
qed:s10,i11:syl |- ( L e. Word 2o -> ( toNat ` L ) < ( 2 ^ ( # ` L ) ) )
